      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso",
          "value": "<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[This is the] marriage [contract] that master Mevasser, the groom, b. Isaac, (may his) e(nd be) g(ood), made for thi[s \u02bfAz\u012bza, the bride, daughter of \u1e24as\u0101n (whose) s(oul is at) r(est).] </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[\"He who finds a wife fin]ds good, and obtains favor of the Lord.\" \"May he see his offspring, prolong his days, and the purpose of the Lord [prosper] by [his hand.\"] </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[\"May the Lord make the] woman who is coming into your house like Rachel and Leah, both of whom built up the h[ouse of Israel.\"] </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[\"And may your house be like the hou]se of Perez whom Tamar bore unto Judah\u2014through the offspring which the Lord will give yo[u by this young woman.\"] </li></ol>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
